WEBVTT

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:48.120
Yahoo! All right!

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:49.920
Listen to this, everyone!

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:54.080
<i>Prince of Fighting</i>, two-hour special...

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.570
What? What?!

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:59.090
Shou, don't tell me you're going to appear on <i>Prince of Fighting</i>...

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:03.000
Shou Kurusu

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.590
That's amazing.

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:06.500
You did it, Shou.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:07.600
Well, yeah.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.100
Give it your best, Shou.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:10.780
Yeah!

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:12.460
Which means you'll have achieved

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:15.470
your heart's desire: performing with Ryuya.

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:17.680
Will you be playing someone's little sister again?

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:22.240
Shou, you looked great in a dress.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.240
Your hard work must have paid off.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:28.620
That's not it at all! I'll be playing an unmistakable man this time!

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.670
I hope I get all kinds of work soon too.

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:34.630
Tokiya is in commercials and dramas.

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:37.920
And you have offers for work, don't you, Ren?

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.670
Modeling work for a magazine.

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:42.970
Idols do more than just sing?

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:43.940
Listen, you!

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:45.320
We do a wide variety of stuff,

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:47.180
from television to movies to theater!

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:51.410
Keep taking on opportunities to show off your talents!

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.700
That's what an idol does!

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:58.660
I see. I had no idea.

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:01.610
Hello, everybody.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:03.990
This voice again...

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:07.180
There he is!

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:08.660
When did you get there?

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:15.490
I heard you rejected the seniors I prepared for you.

00:03:15.490 --> 00:03:16.880
Well...

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:21.170
Working on your own is all well and good!

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:26.350
It's no problem at all if you become actual idols!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:32.680
But you probably think you're already real idols.

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:35.960
We're not? We put out a CD.

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.820
That concert was a success.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:43.110
I told you, the reality is many bloom splendidly...

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:47.950
and then fade like fireworks.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.860
Are you trying to say we're going to fade?

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.290
We're not a one-hit wonder!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:57.340
In that case, you should claim this title!

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:01.630
The Uta☆Pri Award?

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:04.470
Uta☆Pri?

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:07.270
The pinnacle of new idols!

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:10.390
The Uta☆Prince Brand New Award!

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:16.400
Claiming this title will open the path to becoming a true idol!

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.400
Do your best, boys!

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:24.490
What was that all about?

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.820
The Uta☆Pri Award, huh?

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:28.850
You know about it?

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:33.210
Only granted when brilliant new idols appear...

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.410
It is a rare title.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:38.310
Rare?

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:40.710
We're supposed to win an award that amazing?

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.460
What the president said isn't entirely incorrect.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:47.670
ST☆RISH is not as well known as we think.

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:54.410
The quickest way to become established as idols is to claim this title.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:57.600
We should secure a foothold first.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:01.250
Then, let's take the Uta☆Prince Award and stand on top.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.570
If we can do that, the boss can't complain.

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:05.530
Let's do it!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:10.280
Let's become real idols and deliver our songs to even more people!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:14.780
Yeah! With our singing and Nanami's music, I'm sure we can do it!

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:18.980
All right! Let's show them what we're made of!

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:19.920
Yes!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.860
Let's all aim for the pinnacle of new idols together!

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.140
Let's all do our best!

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:26.340
We can totally do it!

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:33.470
What? We have to do more than sell lots of CD's?

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:36.940
It would be too easy if that's all you had to do.

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.890
Listen, in order to win the Uta☆Pri Award,

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:42.440
you have to perform brilliantly

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:44.650
and capture the attention of the Uta☆Pri Committee.

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:47.650
Perform brilliantly?

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:55.990
Your singing matters, of course, but the committee checks all work you do as an idol.

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:57.110
Everything?

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:04.190
The work we do individually affects ST☆RISH's chance of winning.

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:06.860
It's not that easy.

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:10.260
Does that mean you didn't...

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:16.270
I see. We will avenge you.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.620
Shut up! You're not going to avenge anyone!

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:21.100
There's no way you guys can win the Uta☆Pri Award!

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:24.850
The key to winning the award is shining as an idol.

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:27.110
Shining?

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:31.120
The most important aspect of an idol is not his skills,

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.530
but how brightly he shines.

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.510
Look at me! My glow!

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.930
Capturing the hearts of fools is no trouble at all!

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:41.570
I see.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:45.840
The Uta☆Pri Award has nothing to do with you.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:48.130
W-Well...

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.590
Anyway, what happened to the work I gave you yesterday?

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.280
You did it, didn't you?

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:53.720
Not yet.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:58.180
You should do something about yourself before meddling in the affairs of others.

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:10.490
This is amazing. Things are different on the set of a hit series.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.900
I'm starting to feel kind of nervous.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:16.530
Mr. Hyuga!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:20.370
Good morning!

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:27.240
Um, I love this show, and getting to perform with you is like a dream!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.720
I look forward to working with you!

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.050
How naïve.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:34.620
You're already a professional.

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:37.100
Quit acting like an amateur.

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:40.350
We're two actors standing in the same ring.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:43.080
Actually, as two people competing for the same work,

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.520
you could call us enemies.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:49.070
If you don't stop acting like a student, you'll get burned.

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:56.390
Mr. Hyuga...

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:00.840
Kurusu, are you ready?

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.120
Y-Yes!

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:07.410
Ready? The cameras are rolling, so give it everything you have!

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:08.920
Here we go!

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.220
All right...

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:13.880
Let's do this!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.980
Okay, ready...

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:16.850
Start!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.890
Good, okay!

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:39.530
Okay!

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:43.160
Good! Excellent!

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.620
Th-Thank you very much!

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:49.040
Let's move onto the next scene!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:53.760
Kurusu jumps in to save his marooned friend! Let's go!

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.670
Director, we have a stuntman for that...

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:01.770
I want him to do it, though. It's an important scene...

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:04.120
<i>I'm supposed to jump over there?</i>

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:07.020
<i>It's pretty high.</i>

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:09.520
Kurusu, we'll get the stuntman.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:19.870
<i>You're already a professional. Quit acting like an amateur.</i>

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:24.760
<i>He's right. I'm a professional.</i>

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:26.660
<i>I need to be able to do this...</i>

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:30.130
I'll do it! I can do it!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.530
All right, thanks.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:33.640
Hurry up and get ready!

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:34.440
Got it!

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.800
Okay, ready...

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:42.470
Start!

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:45.390
<i>I need to be able...</i>

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.150
<i>to do at least this much!</i>

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:37.560
Damn it.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:40.450
Kurusu!

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:44.450
Um, that's enough. Why don't we take a break?

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:45.300
Huh?

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:50.950
We have no choice. We'll have to use a stuntman just like we originally planned.

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:52.630
Okay.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.630
Excuse me, Director!

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:59.130
Please! Let me try one more time!

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:01.220
Please let me do it!

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:04.830
Director, we can't...

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:06.370
Yeah...

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:08.640
Director...

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:13.060
Do you have a minute?

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:19.830
Shou, I'll help you.

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:22.410
I'll do it myself, so get out!

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:32.060
He's pretty into it.

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:37.240
Apparently, Ryuya asked the director to let him try again...

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:39.300
But he can't do it.

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.470
What?

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:43.800
He's too eager and stiff.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.300
He won't be able to use his full power.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:50.100
For best results, you need to relax.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.940
A relaxed, natural stance is best.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:59.730
<i>Damn it. I should be able to make that jump...</i>

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:03.740
I wonder if there's anything we can do to help him.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:09.410
Shorty's a man. There's nothing for us to do this time.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.330
<i>Shou...</i>

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.800
Shou!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.260
Hooray!

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:24.430
N-Natsuki, what are you doing here?

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:28.220
I knew I was the only one who could help you relax at work,

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.180
so I got a job as an extra.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:33.140
What good is relaxing at work going to do?!

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:34.890
Try to take this a little more seriously!

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.360
So this is a movie set.

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:39.650
Cecil?

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.730
Isn't it exciting?

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:45.820
I thought you'd like it if I brought Cecil with me.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.240
I don't like it at all! Why'd you have to bring Cecil?!

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:51.660
I thought you weren't interested in idols at all!

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:54.960
Myu made Cecil promise

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.380
to study the fundamentals of being an idol.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.420
A prince never goes back on his word.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.670
You don't want to be here at all!

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:05.760
Extras, gather around! Over here!

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:09.430
Do your best, Shou.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.810
Do your best.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.020
Oh, shut up!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:24.030
What? Isn't this Shou's...

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.380
Damn it!

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:52.560
<i>Why can't I do it?</i>

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.810
<i>I should be able to jump this far...</i>

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.190
<i>Why?</i>

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:03.230
Shou, why don't we go home?

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:05.070
We can eat dinner together.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.990
Sure, just leave already!

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:09.070
But...

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:12.830
Just leave! You're distracting me.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:21.580
Natsuki, let's go. There's nothing we can do for him now.

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:38.100
<i>Um, I love this show, and getting to perform with you is like a dream!</i>

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:42.150
I can't be Mr. Hyuga's fan forever.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.020
I...

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.500
What's wrong with me?

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.540
I even forgot my change of clothes...

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.760
There.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:11.380
Shou.

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.100
That voice...

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.060
Shou.

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.440
Nanami, what are you doing here?

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.480
I brought the bag you forgot.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.650
I thought you might need this.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.320
Hey, watch out!

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:35.320
I-It's so high!

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:37.950
Shou, do you always practice up here?

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:39.950
Hey, be careful!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.460
I-I'm scared...

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.300
Okay, that's it! Go back slowly!

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.260
Don't look down!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.800
Okay...

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:55.640
Oh, no! Your bag!

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.430
Don't worry about that! Just leave it!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.970
I can't do that!

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.020
Nanami!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:10.820
Nanami!

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:13.070
Damn it!

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.120
Just you wait, Nanami!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:25.170
Maximum...

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:29.670
Manliness!

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:47.980
Nanami!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:03.330
I'm glad you're all right.

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:12.000
If anything had happened to you, I... I...

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:26.310
I'm sorry. It's my fault...

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.400
Don't worry about it.

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:32.530
Thanks to you, I made the jump.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:39.120
I want this job to be a success, no matter what.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:45.500
If I could do this, I felt like I could move on from being Mr. Hyuga's fan...

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.210
What?

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:51.380
After all, I'm a professional now.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:56.380
You don't have to force yourself to do it.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:58.630
Force myself?

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:03.600
It's important to you, right?

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:10.860
It's given both of us plenty of happiness.

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:15.740
It was the reason you entered this industry.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:21.620
It's our turn to make everyone happy now,

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:27.040
but I don't think you should forget how you felt then.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:32.880
So, you know...

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:36.800
Nanami...

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:46.180
When I saw him this morning, he had an excellent expression on his face.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.640
He may have realized something.

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:56.780
<i>I can do it!</i>

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:31.020
If you're a man, at least protect the woman you love.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:34.440
I'll never forget your words.

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:38.940
You are already a real man.

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:18.860
I'm sorry for pushing you away when you were admiring me.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:25.280
It's clear to me that you're a real man.

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:30.200
Thank you very much.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:36.880
I learned a lot from being allowed to participate.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:43.590
Good work!

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:44.720
Good job!

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.050
Good work today!

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:54.980
Shou, I saw it.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:55.730
Yeah!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.440
You were so cool and wonderful.

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:01.150
Huh? R-Really?

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:09.700
The truth is, I was singing the song you gave me in my heart while I was acting...

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:15.290
Your song is the source of my energy...

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:20.750
I see. That makes me so happy.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:24.220
Apparently, the story is continuing,

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.090
so they asked me if I'd act again.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:28.550
That's amazing, Shou.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.010
It's all thanks to you.

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:31.810
What?

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:37.560
Because of your words, I knew I could be my usual self.

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:39.690
That's why I was able to do it.

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:42.320
Shou...

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:50.160
You understand my feelings better than anyone else...

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.700
I promise you...

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.290
Even if I become a professional,

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:56.750
I'll be an idol who doesn't forget what it's like to be a fan.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:01.130
I hope to become that kind of composer too.

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:04.000
I'm fired up!

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:05.050
Okay, first...

00:22:05.710 --> 00:22:09.470
I'll form my own fan club and recruit members!

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:11.430
I'll join!

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:13.640
What good will that do?

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:15.390
Can't I?

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:17.690
It's not like you can't, but...

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:18.850
Okay, I've got something special.

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.030
It's your certificate of membership.

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:27.820
What? Are you sure?

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:29.280
Take good care of it.

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:31.490
Thank you so much.
